---
import { invitation as w, asset } from '../data/invitation';
import EventDetails from '../components/chapter/EventDetails.astro';
import '../styles/experience.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"/><title>Swarnimam & Plabini — A celebration awaits</title><meta name="theme-color" content="#102c27"/><link rel="icon" href={asset('favicon.svg')}/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&family=Noto+Serif+Devanagari:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
<body><a class="skip" href="#celebrations">Skip to celebrations</a>
<div class="world" aria-hidden="true" style={`background-image:url(${asset('images/garden/forever-night.webp')})`}><canvas id="courtyard"></canvas></div><div class="world-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<header><a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Swarnimam and Plabini, home"><img src={asset('images/chapter/monogram.webp')} width="56" height="56" alt="PS wedding monogram"/></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#invitation">Invitation</a><a href="#celebrations">Celebrations</a><a href="#venue">Directions ↗</a></nav></header>
<main id="main"><section class="arrival scene" id="home"><div class="arrival-copy"><p class="eyebrow">8–9 December 2026 · Gaya</p><h1>Swarnimam<i>&</i>Plabini</h1><p class="intro">A lifetime together.<br/>Beginning with you beside us.</p><a class="enter" href="#invitation">Your invitation <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></section>
<section class="invitation scene" id="invitation"><p class="eyebrow">For you, with love</p><h2>Some moments<br/><em>belong to all of us.</em></h2><details class="letter"><summary><span class="flap" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src={asset('images/chapter/monogram.webp')} width="84" height="84" alt="PS wax seal"/><span class="closed-label">Open your invitation</span><span class="open-label">Close the letter</span></summary><div class="paper"><img class="ganesha" src={asset('images/chapter/ganesha.webp')} width="78" height="78" alt="Lord Ganesha, from our invitation"/><p lang="hi">॥ श्री गणेशाय नमः ॥</p><h3>The Kumars &amp; The Nayaks</h3><p>request the pleasure of your company<br/>at the wedding of their children</p><p class="letter-names">Swarnimam <i>&amp;</i> Plabini</p><p lang="hi">पावन परिणयोत्सव की मंगल बेला पर<br/>सपरिवार पधारकर वर-वधू को आशीर्वाद दें।</p><p>9 December 2026 · 7:30 pm<br/>{w.venue.name}, Gaya</p><a href="#celebrations">Discover the celebrations ↓</a></div></details></section>
    <section id="story" class="story section-space" aria-labelledby="story-title">
      <div class="section-caption"><span>OUR STORY</span></div>
      <h2 id="story-title" class="editorial-title" data-reveal>We shared a campus.<br /><em>Then we found each other.</em></h2>
      <div class="story-grid">
        <div class="story-copy"><p class="lead">The person we would marry was at the same university. We just hadn’t met yet.</p><p>At VIT-AP University, Plabini was one year senior to Swarnimam. We had friends in common and a campus in common, but somehow, never a conversation.</p><p>It took a new city to change that. After the pandemic, Swarnimam moved to Bangalore for his first job. Plabini was already there, and through close mutual friends, she became one of the first people he got to know.</p><p>What college never quite managed, Bangalore made easy.</p></div>
        <div class="paths" data-path-scene aria-label="From Aliganj and Rourkela, our paths met in Bangalore"><div class="path-origins"><span>ALIGANJ<small>Swarnimam</small></span><span>ROURKELA<small>Plabini</small></span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 400 240" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path class="path-base" d="M50 5C50 145 200 45 200 230M350 5C350 145 200 45 200 230"/><path class="draw-path" pathLength="1" d="M50 5C50 145 200 45 200 230"/><path class="draw-path second" pathLength="1" d="M350 5C350 145 200 45 200 230"/><circle cx="200" cy="230" r="5"/></svg><p>BANGALORE<small>Where our story began.</small></p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="city-scene" data-scroll-scene><div class="city-type" aria-hidden="true"><span>A new city.</span><em>A familiar feeling.</em></div><div class="city-moments"><p><span>THE PLACES</span>A city to discover together.</p><p><span>THE PLANS</span>Food trails. Films. Time for one another.</p><p><span>THE FEELING</span>Somewhere along the way, it became us.</p></div><p class="city-caption">There were food outings, evenings at the movies and all the little discoveries that make a new city your own. We laughed, wandered and grew closer. What began as friendship became the part of our lives we couldn’t imagine doing without.</p><svg class="city-lines" viewBox="0 0 800 500" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-100 100C400 -50 100 600 900 300"/><path d="M-100 140C450 0 150 650 900 340"/></svg></div>
      <p class="story-turn" data-reveal>By the time we talked about forever,<br /><em>we had already found it in the everyday.</em></p>
    </section>

<section class="celebrations" id="celebrations"><div class="celebration-intro"><p class="motto">Two days <i>✧</i> Four celebrations <i>✧</i> One forever</p><p class="eyebrow">Four celebrations. Four worlds.</p><h2>Every moment,<br/><em>its own kind of magic.</em></h2></div>
{w.events.map((event,i)=><article class={`celebration celebration-${i} scene`} id={event.id} data-event={i}><div class="event-art"><img src={asset(`images/garden/${['tilak-family','sangeet-dance','haldi-family','vivah-agni'][i]}-1024.webp`)} srcset={`${asset(`images/garden/${['tilak-family','sangeet-dance','haldi-family','vivah-agni'][i]}-640.webp`)} 640w, ${asset(`images/garden/${['tilak-family','sangeet-dance','haldi-family','vivah-agni'][i]}-1024.webp`)} 1024w`} sizes="(min-width: 800px) 40vw, 88vw" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy" alt={['An imagined family Tilak gathering','Families dancing at an imagined Sangeet','An imagined Haldi celebration','An imagined red mandap with agni and pheras'][i]}/></div><div class="event-copy"><p lang="hi" class="hindi">{event.hindi}</p><h2>{event.name}</h2><p class="description">{event.description}</p><EventDetails index={i}/></div></article>)}
</section><section id="venue" class="venue scene"><p class="eyebrow">Together in Gaya</p><h2>We can’t wait<br/><em>to celebrate with you.</em></h2><p>Greater Rajwada Resort<br/>Manpur, Gaya · Near Mehta Petrol Pump</p><a class="direction" href={w.venue.mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open directions ↗</a><p class="signoff">With love, Swarnimam &amp; Plabini</p><a href="#home">Back to top ↑</a></section></main>
<script src="../scripts/courtyard.ts"></script></body></html>
